  (text "Fuse and series resistor per Mornsun's LD03 application circuit. MOV after the fuse, thermally protected type.\nF1 is a 1500 A breaking-capacity fuse: if RV1 fails short, F1 must interrupt the circuit's prospective fault current." (at 21.5900 140.9700 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 58ab640c-3f67-48ac-a56d-dc97814f1bb9))
