  (rectangle (start 179.07 199.39) (end 381.0 316.23) (stroke (width 0.35) (type default)) (fill (type color) (color 214 92 64 0.10)) (uuid d3f00723-6ffc-4bab-9f82-cfafe0bae8ae))
  (text "5. POLARITY AND EARTH CHECK" (at 180.3400 200.6600 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 3d50a1fc-9b03-4170-8233-c0cb1286a03c))
  (text "Arm A: E -> 2 x 2M (HV) -> sense 20k -> L_BUS.  Arm B: E -> 2 x 2M (HV) + 20k -> N_F, so a missing earth floats to mid-supply.\nPeak detector BAT54WS + 1u // 1M (tau 1 s); thresholds 1.02 V (bit A) and 0.31 V (bit B) from a 220k/68k/30k ladder,\nwith about 100 mV of hysteresis from R33/R34 so the bits cannot chatter near a threshold.\nCorrect: A=1 B=1.  Swapped L/N: A=0 B=0.  No earth: A=0 B=1.  Each arm must withstand a 6 kV impulse: VR37-class HV resistors." (at 180.3400 204.4700 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 8ea78814-e7b6-43c9-afaa-977f28a7b315))
